{"reviewId": "429503504_84iPOIVYP", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "我们大多数90后（1990-1999年出生）正好出生在第五次康波周期的“衰退末期”和“萧条期”，童年/少年时期（90年代-21世纪初）：他们成长于信息技术革命（互联网）的“红利扩散期”，见证了科技的飞速发展，但自身并未参与财富创造。青年时期（2008年后）：当他们开始上大学或步入社会时，迎头撞上了由2008年金融危机开启的全球性“萧条期”。经济增速放缓，旧的机会在减少，新的技术革命尚未成熟到能创造大量新财富和就业。 “内卷”一词在90后中流行绝非偶然。它精准地描述了在有限资源下，所有人不断加大投入，却导致人均收益下降的窘境。做时间的朋友，如果周期在衰退末期那么就强身健体，等待下一个上升期吧", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "1190-1216", "abstract": "个人出生在康波中的时点几乎就注定了其一生的经济轨迹。", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 0, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "429503504_84iPOIVYP", "userVid": 429503504, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761877180, "author": {"userVid": 429503504, "name": "钾离子", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0014-hpYPrBheR94RCBF7NvCmV10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-50", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 50}}, "userEditTime": 1762496794, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 52930967, "name": "四叶草", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epGyUoSydQEvOND2N8wnxQbepZWjicfNxUGcbI51DYKSBcomVjK3JKKvwPiaOxGJhohtaJIIkpMIObQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments":